cope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/transition.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/txn.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/verify_authorship.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"src/rebar/_commands/verify_opcert.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","d6eb-1c6c-88c3-48f6"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"d6eb-1c6c-88c3-48f6","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"ab62-e1a6-df62-42fa","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in src/rebar/_commands — cohort 03: transition–verify_opcert","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["c929c2d9-4ddf-45a9-ac50-5dd0f2795de7","f241001e-0064-489b-ac97-244630692266","9e991a41-090d-47f4-a721-6e50ac445af7","b42fa467-89b2-4fa3-b79b-fe8e0834fce3","8f056071-6bce-4b65-95ed-a7bf34af23c2","b8c339fc-5370-4050-a863-1b9c1ace6233"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126